  "notes": "This tranche separates ordinary geometry admission from specialized render-mode handlers and records geometry and pre-resolve dispatch as distinct tables. The pinned evidence maps CommonLib's precipitation-occlusion name to mode 28 while the exact specialized occlusion-property handler occupies table index 29; that semantic discrepancy remains explicit and unresolved. Live handler frequency and scene-specific mode use require runtime evidence."
